{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28123","headline":"卢岳闲居十韵 · 雍陶","name":"卢岳闲居十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扰扰走人寰，争如占得闲。\n防愁心付酒，求静力登山。\n见药芳时采，逢花好处攀。\n望云开病眼，临涧洗愁颜。\n春色流岩下，秋声碎竹间。\n锦文苔点点，钱样菊斑斑。\n路远朝无客，门深夜不关。\n鹤飞高缥缈，莺语巧绵蛮。\n养拙甘沈默，忘怀绝险艰。\n更怜云外路，空去又空还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}